04:40:36,240 --> 04:40:36,640
Hold on a minute.

5456
04:40:37,140 --> 04:40:38,020
I need to see something.

5457
04:40:40,180 --> 04:40:40,640
What's this?

5458
04:40:40,880 --> 04:40:41,260
Lazarus.

5459
04:40:42,580 --> 04:40:44,220
That's the guy that came back from the dead.

5460
04:40:45,300 --> 04:40:46,480
But he had to die first.

5461
04:40:48,260 --> 04:40:49,840
He has minus five poops?

5462
04:40:51,260 --> 04:40:52,100
What does that mean?

5463
04:40:53,020 --> 04:40:53,720
Oh wait, that's win streak.

5464
04:40:54,160 --> 04:40:55,020
I have no wins!

5465
04:40:56,440 --> 04:40:57,680
I'm doing so bad.

5466
04:40:59,720 --> 04:41:02,420
Also, it's always on hard, no matter what character I choose.

5467
04:41:03,640 --> 04:41:04,860
I like Azazel a lot.

5468
04:41:05,000 --> 04:41:06,660
This is my favorite character so far.

5469
04:41:07,860 --> 04:41:10,680
Lazarus, three hearts, two boots, two attack.

5470
04:41:14,550 --> 04:41:15,430
Oh, that's the same as Isaac.

5471
04:41:16,570 --> 04:41:18,450
So there's got to be like some kind of difference though.

5472
04:41:19,770 --> 04:41:21,290
That is not shown here, you know?

5473
04:41:23,170 --> 04:41:23,270
Dope.

5474
04:41:26,590 --> 04:41:27,630
But that's it for now.

5475
04:41:31,670 --> 04:41:34,590
Guys, this is difficult.

5476
04:41:36,070 --> 04:41:36,870
Very difficult.

5477
04:41:38,790 --> 04:41:41,590
I definitely underestimated the difficulty at first.

5478
04:41:43,490 --> 04:41:49,130
Like, you know, when you start into the game, you shoot the projectiles, you know, the enemies are kind of slow.

5479
04:41:50,110 --> 04:41:50,910
I was like, okay.

5480
04:41:51,850 --> 04:41:53,310
I knew it was going to get harder, of course.

5481
04:41:54,250 --> 04:41:56,170
But I wasn't prepared for how much harder.

5482
04:41:57,570 --> 04:42:00,430
I feel like I kind of nailed the game on normal though.

5483
04:42:00,590 --> 04:42:02,710
Like, I showed it who's boss, you know?

5484
04:42:03,270 --> 04:42:05,810
Then I went on hard and the reverse happened.

5485
04:42:08,770 --> 04:42:10,210
First impression, I like it.

5486
04:42:10,310 --> 04:42:11,230
It's a great game.

5487
04:42:13,410 --> 04:42:15,490
I can already see lots of fun.

5488
04:42:15,770 --> 04:42:20,050
Like, when I saw the list of items, I still can't believe it.

5489
04:42:20,770 --> 04:42:24,350
Because I feel like when I walk through these levels, I'm kind of finding a lot of the same items.

5490
04:42:25,170 --> 04:42:26,690
So how on earth are there that many items?

5491
04:42:28,050 --> 04:42:28,610
That's nuts.

5492
04:42:32,860 --> 04:42:33,060
Right?

5493
04:42:40,380 --> 04:42:42,020
Yeah, I noticed that, Yudhuri.

5494
04:42:42,660 --> 04:42:44,980
All kinds of things are affected by it.

5495
04:42:46,120 --> 04:42:50,380
I feel like also just the number of enemies has changed on hard.

5496
04:42:53,000 --> 04:42:54,560
But yeah, guys, don't spoil anything.

5497
04:42:54,740 --> 04:42:55,880
I see some messages being deleted.

5498
04:42:56,040 --> 04:42:56,500
Thank you, Frank.

5499
04:42:58,380 --> 04:42:59,600
Let me figure it out on my own.

5500
04:43:02,240 --> 04:43:03,920
Yeah, it is kind of addicting.

5501
04:43:05,200 --> 04:43:06,660
I kind of just want to go again and again.

5502
04:43:07,180 --> 04:43:08,060
But now I'm really hungry.

5503
04:43:09,540 --> 04:43:10,960
Oh, and this music is really good.

5504
04:43:14,200 --> 04:43:16,040
This is actually such a good track.

5505
04:43:19,760 --> 04:43:20,860
It's super hard.

5506
04:43:22,960 --> 04:43:23,400
What's next?

5507
04:43:23,660 --> 04:43:24,720
Next is me eating dinner.

5508
04:43:26,040 --> 04:43:28,200
And the next stream, we're gonna play Ocarina...

5509
04:43:28,200 --> 04:43:29,180
Not Ocarina of Time.

5510
04:43:30,700 --> 04:43:31,300
Majora's Mask.

5511
04:43:32,120 --> 04:43:33,460
I think I'm getting close to the end there.

5512
04:43:34,060 --> 04:43:36,500
And then after that, we're gonna do more icing, of course.

5513
04:43:39,120 --> 04:43:40,400
We're going for the 1k hours?

5514
04:43:40,700 --> 04:43:42,160
It depends how much fun I'm having.

5515
04:43:42,840 --> 04:43:45,620
If I'm still having fun in a thousand hours, yeah, of course.

5516
04:43:46,540 --> 04:43:47,460
But if not, then no.

5517
04:43:47,820 --> 04:43:48,500
It's very simple.

5518
04:43:53,950 --> 04:43:55,630
I'm glad you guys are enjoying the ice extreme.

5519
04:43:59,400 --> 04:44:00,520
Can you say hi to Meteor Town?

5520
04:44:01,060 --> 04:44:01,860
Hi Meteor Town.

5521
04:44:03,300 --> 04:44:03,880
What is that?

5522
04:44:03,960 --> 04:44:04,440
Is that a band?

5523
04:44:05,000 --> 04:44:06,040
Sounds like a band to me.

5524
04:44:10,730 --> 04:44:12,390
At some point, you must start using mods.

5525
04:44:13,850 --> 04:44:14,110
Why?

5526
04:44:15,550 --> 04:44:18,630
People kept saying that about Minecraft as well, and I had plenty of fun.

5527
04:44:20,810 --> 04:44:21,490
But we'll see.

5528
04:44:21,610 --> 04:44:23,130
I'm gonna start playing the game as it is, though.

5529
04:44:23,790 --> 04:44:25,090
See how long I get with that.

5530
04:44:32,150 --> 04:44:32,630
What's up, Hive?

5531
04:44:33,390 --> 04:44:33,910
Happy birthday.

5532
04:44:37,320 --> 04:44:38,440
We love eyesack?

5533
04:44:39,600 --> 04:44:42,360
I mean, there's definitely an obsession with eyes in this game.

5534
04:44:43,480 --> 04:44:48,340
I was horrified to read about the scooper scooping out his own eye.

5535
04:44:49,100 --> 04:44:50,600
Like that is just messed up.

5536
04:44:55,680 --> 04:44:59,740
There's one cosmetic mod everyone uses that just adds a little dance when you find good items.

5537
04:45:01,700 --> 04:45:05,160
I feel like that is not good, though.

5538
04:45:05,960 --> 04:45:08,600
Because that immediately tells me what items are good and which ones aren't.

5539
04:45:08,740 --> 04:45:11,080
And I kind of want to figure that out on my own.

5540
04:45:11,640 --> 04:45:12,040
Am I crazy?

5541
04:45:12,640 --> 04:45:14,120
That sounds like a huge spoiler of a mod.

5542
04:45:17,110 --> 04:45:17,710
Like, what the fuck?

5543
04:45:20,510 --> 04:45:24,670
But maybe later, when I've seen all the items, then we can do it.

5544
04:45:26,250 --> 04:45:27,810
But that sounds like a lot of fun, actually.

5545
04:45:27,930 --> 04:45:28,930
It makes your character dance.

5546
04:45:30,230 --> 04:45:30,590
Yeah.

5547
04:45:34,880 --> 04:45:37,220
Does any of you actually have all the items in the game?

5548
04:45:39,420 --> 04:45:40,640
Is it hard to get to?

5549
04:45:44,210 --> 04:45:45,150
How's your kitty doing?

5550
04:45:45,370 --> 04:45:46,010
She's doing great.

5551
04:45:46,970 --> 04:45:47,910
I'm actually about to feed her.

5552
04:45:48,390 --> 04:45:50,110
Because we eat dinner together these days.

5553
04:45:51,370 --> 04:45:54,330
She's going to get wet food tonight, so she's always excited for that.

5554
04:45:59,860 --> 04:46:01,260
A friend of mine nearly has all of them.

5555
04:46:01,360 --> 04:46:02,420
Oh, a lot of you are saying yes.

5556
04:46:02,760 --> 04:46:03,360
Ooh, wow.

5557
04:46:03,980 --> 04:46:04,260
Okay.

5558
04:46:05,160 --> 04:46:07,660
I imagine that requires a lot of commitment.

5559
04:46:14,690 --> 04:46:17,210
Some unlocks are almost impossible without the wiki.

5560
04:46:18,270 --> 04:46:19,030
I imagine so.

5561
04:46:21,590 --> 04:46:23,130
You get an achievement if you unlock everything?

5562
04:46:23,250 --> 04:46:24,290
I would sure hope so!

5563
04:46:25,890 --> 04:46:27,190
Like, imagine if you didn't.

5564
04:46:28,950 --> 04:46:30,170
You got everything now.

5565
04:46:30,710 --> 04:46:31,210
Go outside.

5566
04:46:33,550 --> 04:46:34,870
That's the only message you get.

5567
04:46:35,750 --> 04:46:38,070
I mean, I would demand an achievement, at least.

5568
04:46:38,070 --> 04:46:40,090
Even though I don't really care about achievements.

5569
04:46:40,410 --> 04:46:43,370
Even I would demand an achievement, if I got all the items.

5570
04:46:49,480 --> 04:46:52,020
Intrinsic joy of watching the number go up, Stanley Parable style.

5571
04:46:52,800 --> 04:46:54,120
Wait, what do you mean Stanley Parable style?

5572
04:46:56,380 --> 04:47:01,000
And try not to spoil anything from Stanley Parable now, but watching the number go up.

5573
04:47:04,340 --> 04:47:07,580
Maybe you're talking about gathering certain things in that game.

5574
04:47:08,200 --> 04:47:09,380
It's probably about your meaning, right?

5575
04:47:10,440 --> 04:47:11,500
What's your favorite item so far?

5576
04:47:11,500 --> 04:47:13,620
It's the money glasses!

5577
04:47:15,240 --> 04:47:16,760
Mostly because I love how they look.

5578
04:47:17,420 --> 04:47:18,440
They are so good.

5579
04:47:19,820 --> 04:47:22,200
I just love looking at Isaac when he has them on.

5580
04:47:24,060 --> 04:47:24,420
Hell yeah.

5581
04:47:24,640 --> 04:47:27,980
I wanna become rich and successful in the Isaac world.

5582
04:47:34,240 --> 04:47:35,040
Wait, it's difficult.

5583
04:47:35,240 --> 04:47:35,960
It's a difficult game.

5584
04:47:36,880 --> 04:47:37,040
Noita?

5585
04:47:38,040 --> 04:47:38,640
Let me think.

5586
04:47:39,440 --> 04:47:40,260
What is actually harder?

5587
04:47:40,520 --> 04:47:41,620
Noita or this so far?

5588
04:47:42,180 --> 04:47:45,820
I would say Noita so far, but I haven't really played that much of this game, right?

5589
04:47:46,780 --> 04:47:47,900
Noita is definitely...

5590
04:47:49,580 --> 04:47:54,680
That game can punish you without any warning at all.

5591
04:47:54,780 --> 04:47:55,320
You're dead, you know?

5592
04:47:55,760 --> 04:47:56,300
That is rough.

5593
04:47:57,720 --> 04:47:58,840
Doesn't feel like that's the case here.

5594
04:47:59,780 --> 04:48:02,100
Like, in that last run, I definitely messed it up bad.

5595
04:48:02,940 --> 04:48:07,900
I was totally on autopilot, just, you know, speaking, not really paying attention.

5596
04:48:11,880 --> 04:48:13,820
It's a childhood game for you and your brother.

5597
04:48:16,000 --> 04:48:16,340
Awesome.

5598
04:48:17,340 --> 04:48:19,980
I'm glad you guys are enjoying this, because I am as well.

5599
04:48:20,320 --> 04:48:21,900
That's when it really happens, you know?

5600
04:48:22,360 --> 04:48:24,960
When you guys are enjoying it and I'm enjoying it.

5601
04:48:25,500 --> 04:48:27,520
That's when the symbiosis really hits peak.

5602
04:48:29,360 --> 04:48:30,960
It doesn't get better than that.

5603
04:48:33,140 --> 04:48:34,740
Even Jackie wanted to play this game.

5604
04:48:35,060 --> 04:48:38,720
I was taking a break, and then when I came back, Jackie was sitting here, you know?

5605
04:48:39,000 --> 04:48:42,020
In front of the microphone, like, I'm playing now.

5606
04:48:42,860 --> 04:48:44,120
And I'm picking a Zazel.

5607
04:48:50,050 --> 04:48:50,890
I'm her brother.

5608
04:48:51,630 --> 04:48:53,370
Oh, really?

5609
04:48:54,550 --> 04:48:54,890
Oh, shit.

5610
04:48:56,170 --> 04:48:56,630
Well, there you go.

5611
04:49:01,220 --> 04:49:01,680
That was so fun.

5612
04:49:01,920 --> 04:49:02,780
Yeah, wasn't it?

5613
04:49:04,020 --> 04:49:05,160
And you know what the best part is?

5614
04:49:05,520 --> 04:49:07,700
Every single run I've done has felt so different, too.

5615
04:49:08,500 --> 04:49:13,100
That one crazy run I had, where I had this weird-ass fucking laser circle.

5616
04:49:13,620 --> 04:49:14,960
Like, what the shit is that?

5617
04:49:16,540 --> 04:49:22,620
Like, if I even hadn't gotten that today, there's no way in hell I would have predicted that such an item would exist.

5618
04:49:23,600 --> 04:49:23,780
You know?

5619
04:49:23,980 --> 04:49:24,500
Like, what the...

5620
04:49:25,320 --> 04:49:26,020
That's awesome.

5621
04:49:31,910 --> 04:49:36,490
If you get 100% achievement in less than 100 additional hours, then you get the speedrun world record.

5622
04:49:37,810 --> 04:49:40,170
Okay, so let's try and go for that, then.

5623
04:49:40,770 --> 04:49:41,310
That sounds good.

5624
04:49:41,830 --> 04:49:43,330
Except I'm idling in the menu now.

5625
04:49:43,910 --> 04:49:45,930
It's probably a bad idea, huh, if I want to get that.

5626
04:49:46,490 --> 04:49:51,950
Or maybe it's, like, in-game time when you're in a run, I don't know.

5627
04:49:55,920 --> 04:49:58,400
Are people actually speedrunning, like, getting all the items?

5628
04:50:01,180 --> 04:50:02,140
Is that a thing?

5629
04:50:03,360 --> 04:50:04,120
Why am I asking?

5630
04:50:04,240 --> 04:50:05,080
Of course it's a thing.

5631
04:50:05,560 --> 04:50:06,340
People are insane.

5632
04:50:08,180 --> 04:50:10,480
There's this guy that played all the Souls games.

5633
04:50:11,320 --> 04:50:14,080
Sekido, Elden Ring, everything.

5634
04:50:15,180 --> 04:50:16,060
Without dying once.

5635
04:50:18,140 --> 04:50:19,740
Like, oh my god.

5636
04:50:20,840 --> 04:50:23,500
That is just next level of commitment and dedication, right?

5637
04:50:25,040 --> 04:50:26,920
112 hours is current record.

5638
04:50:29,040 --> 04:50:31,240
But you can't even stay awake for that long.

5639
04:50:31,340 --> 04:50:35,360
It's gotta be, like, over multiple streams, otherwise that is just actually a health hazard.

5640
04:50:36,580 --> 04:50:37,900
Of course it's over multiple streams.

5641
04:50:38,020 --> 04:50:40,720
There's no way someone is doing that straight up in one go.

5642
04:50:45,490 --> 04:50:46,270
That's crazy.

5643
04:50:50,150 --> 04:50:51,870
Steeping time included in the speedrun.

5644
04:50:52,090 --> 04:50:53,310
Wait, are you kidding or are you serious?

5645
04:50:54,930 --> 04:50:55,810
Oh, you're kidding, okay.

5646
04:50:56,550 --> 04:50:57,510
You're kidding, okay, I see.

5647
04:51:00,770 --> 04:51:03,170
I mean, if that was a thing, I would honestly watch it.

5648
04:51:04,610 --> 04:51:07,430
I think that could be entertaining in its own way.

5649
04:51:12,490 --> 04:51:13,810
Guys, I'm outta here.

5650
04:51:14,330 --> 04:51:15,550
Thank you all for joining me on this.

5651
04:51:15,910 --> 04:51:16,790
This was a lot of fun.

5652
04:51:17,550 --> 04:51:18,590
This is a great game.

5653
04:51:19,290 --> 04:51:25,470
How come every single game you guys end up voting for that always wins the vote always has the best music?

5654
04:51:27,350 --> 04:51:31,390
It has always, always been a 100% thing with that.

5655
04:51:31,950 --> 04:51:33,210
Maybe with the exception of one game.

5656
04:51:33,770 --> 04:51:34,430
You know which one.

5657
04:51:35,210 --> 04:51:37,690
But all the others, like, the music just slaps.

5658
04:51:38,770 --> 04:51:44,070
It's almost like there's a correlation between how good a game is and how good the music in that game is.

5659
04:51:44,810 --> 04:51:46,450
Music means so much in a game.

5660
04:51:47,230 --> 04:51:48,870
It matters so much.

5661
04:51:50,230 --> 04:51:51,830
Who puts the games on the vote list?

5662
04:51:51,830 --> 04:51:53,230
Some guy named Daniel.

5663
04:51:53,510 --> 04:51:54,470
I don't even know him.

5664
04:51:55,010 --> 04:51:57,330
Like, he just emails me like, these are the games.

5665
04:51:57,790 --> 04:51:59,390
And I'm like, okay, I put them on the list, right?

5666
04:52:00,110 --> 04:52:02,010
I don't question it, I just do it.

5667
04:52:02,410 --> 04:52:02,650
So yeah.

5668
04:52:04,430 --> 04:52:05,250
I'm kidding, of course.

5669
04:52:05,430 --> 04:52:06,490
It's me, I pick the games.

5670
04:52:07,270 --> 04:52:08,070
Come on now.

5671
04:52:08,570 --> 04:52:11,730
Anyway, guys, thanks for watching and subscribing and hanging out with me.

5672
04:52:12,270 --> 04:52:13,190
Having fun with this?

5673
04:52:13,290 --> 04:52:14,310
Because I sure had a lot of fun.

5674
04:52:14,910 --> 04:52:16,550
I will see you in the next stream slash video, alright?

5675
04:52:17,250 --> 04:52:18,850
Have a wonderful Saturday.

5676
04:52:19,290 --> 04:52:21,910
And don't you dare have a bad Sunday.

5677
04:52:22,030 --> 04:52:22,690
I'll see you, bye-bye.

